panA0aI1ppW7kVD9J3m-ZYVk0A&oe=6B0DA141"}, {"file_name": "03_training_in_the_cockpit_vr.png", "id": "3030868800610098", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_3030868803943431_3217698245431716267_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z6zYiyTVCyUQ7kNvwG6rFD5&_nc_oc=Adplsi2-1e_0VjjMpusTAiN-doYJd5s04CdXGZBkjI5piwjK0-q4B7OyRKn8eBbF_uI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR4sqaNp_OfuBQBAJWoc9P7M62wqo--xeTEIHrt7nvYng&oe=6B0DB769"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Astervolt", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Astervolt is a 3D arcade space shooter, and in the headset you sit in the pilot's seat. Fly a small ship freely through asteroid fields and enemy fleets and take great warships apart.\n\nNO ONE TOLD THEM THE WAR WAS OVER\n\nPLAYING IN VR\n- Fly with the Touch controllers: the left stick moves and slides the ship, the right stick turns its nose, the right trigger fires, the grips roll; the other buttons raise the shield, change guns and use your special and your captain's ability.\n- Watch from behind the ship, from the cockpit or from the holographic SIM cockpit - press the right stick to change the view. The 2D modes work in the headset too.\n- The HUD hangs before you in flight; menus float in space - point with your right hand and pull the trigger.\n- Press the left stick to recentre your seat.\n\nTHE CAMPAIGN\nThirty story missions in five chapters and six side missions, against the Graft Collective and the traitors of Helion. Four captains, a decision after every mission and three endings. A narrator and the whole cast speak over a crackling field radio - every line is voiced in English.\n\nMORE WAYS TO PLAY\n- The shooter: 110 levels with turning rock fields, great ships and fights inside tunnels.\n- Free play: an endless run through generated sectors, with a boss in every fifth.\n- Network game: up to four players on the local network, or one ship for two.\n\nWHAT YOU FLY AND FIGHT\n- Eight ships, 43 weapons, shields and modules.\n- Great ships out of hyperspace: strike their escort, brid", "short_description": "Take the pilot's seat and fly freely through asteroid fields and enemy fleets. A fully voiced campaign of thirty missions, 110 shooter levels and endless free play - with your head in the cockpit.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rorbit.pl/policy.html#astervolt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RORBIT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.rorbit.pl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1522484317604481"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1459073769704026_8100761066844928918_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q6Of03_pVoMQ7kNvwHA1OR9&_nc_oc=AdpJGkNvqlqk7AE-dYXwKWGdJbBbuFnfpK6GBQ8dvxjHbpRlF0L7FfCDStcn-WpglP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRkkQVcZvtwWZ9YtAAMfkbRnt5KFnrxTFUeUSvcnWb8SQ&oe=6B0DA1CC"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Astervolt", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_ca